  "js_operations":["RegExp.prototype.exec","RegExp.prototype.test","String.prototype.search","String.prototype.replace"],
  "implementation_notes":["Do not assume JavaScript, POSIX ERE, PCRE2, Python, and C++ regex have identical escapes or flags.","The supplied article's \d+ and \D+ examples mean one or more characters; zero-or-more is *."]
